  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm a Software Engineer based in Ottawa, Ontario, Canada, originally from Cuba.
    I started programming on an MSX with 64KB of RAM — BASIC, Logo and Z-80 assembly
    on a tape recorder and a black-and-white TV — and worked my way up through
    QuickBASIC, Turbo Pascal, Turbo C and x86 assembly.
  </p>
